t;:&quot;Credits&quot;,&quot;Map.Title&quot;:&quot;Rova 4 on the map: the projects, urban renewal and the neighbourhood&quot;,&quot;Marker.Title&quot;:&quot;Marker&quot;,&quot;Popup.Close&quot;:&quot;Close&quot;},&quot;lrt&quot;:&quot;Light rail&quot;}}"><header class="nlam__head"><p class="nlam__kicker">Location</p><h2 class="nlam__title" id="nlam-t">Rova <span class="nlam__num">4</span> on the map: the projects, urban renewal and the neighbourhood</h2><p class="nlam__lead">Between Ibn Gabirol Street and the Ayalon Highway, and from the Yarkon to Shaul HaMelech Boulevard: the residential towers around Kikar HaMedina, the buildings going through urban renewal, and the schools, parks, cafés and light rail of Rova <span class="nlam__num">4</span>.</p></header><div class="nlam__chips" role="group" aria-label="Show on the map"><button type="button" class="nlam__chip" data-cat="projects" aria-pressed="true" disabled><span class="nlam__sw nlam__sw--pill" style="--c:var(--am-projects)"></span>Projects <span class="nlam__n">6</span></button><button type="button" class="nlam__chip" data-cat="renewal" aria-pressed="true" disabled><span class="nlam__sw nlam__sw--sq" style="--c:var(--am-renewal)"></span>Urban renewal <span class="nlam__n">15</span></button><button type="button" class="nlam__chip" data-cat="edu" aria-pressed="true" disabled><span class="nlam__sw" style="--c:var(--am-edu)"></span>Schools and kindergartens <span class="nlam__n">11</span></button><button type="button" class="nlam__chip" data-cat="parks" aria-pressed="true" disabled><span class="nlam__sw" style="--c:var(--am-parks)"></span>Parks <span class="nlam__n">19</span></button><button type="button" class="nlam__chip" data-cat="shop" aria-pressed="true" disabled><span class="nlam__sw" style="--c:var(--am-shop)"></span>Shopping <span class="nlam__n">43</span></button><button type="button" class="nlam__chip" data-cat="transit" aria-pressed="true" disabled><span class="nlam__sw" style="--c:var(--am-transit)"></span>Transport <span class="nlam__n">4</span></button></div><div class="nlam__frame"><div class="nlam__map" role="region" aria-label="Rova 4 on the map: the projects, urban renewal and the neighbourhood"></div><div class="nlam__wait" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M9 4.5 3.5 6.5v13l5.5-2 6 2 5.5-2v-13l-5.5 2-6-2z"/><path d="M9 4.5v13M15 6.5v13"/></svg><span>Loading the map</span></div><button type="button" class="nlam__reset"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.65" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M3 12a9 9 0 1 0 3-6.7"/><path d="M3 4v5h5"/></svg>Back to overview</button><div class="nlam__key" aria-hidden="true"><i></i>District boundary, approximate</div><div class="nlam__card" role="dialog" aria-modal="false" aria-labelledby="nlam-ch" hidden><button type="button" class="nlam__x" aria-label="Close"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 6l12 12M18 6L6 18"/></svg></button><div class="nlam__cb"></div></div></div><p class="nlam__cap">Illustrative map. Locations from <bdi>OpenStreetMap</bdi>; urban renewal projects from published reports, updated <span class="nlam__num">7</span> October <span class="nlam__num">2026</span>. <a class="nlam__osm" href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><bdi>© OpenStreetMap contributors</bdi></a></p><p class="nlam__failnote">The map is not available right now. These are the places it shows:</p><details class="nlam__list"><summary>All the projects and places on the map</summary><h3 class="nlam__lh">Projects</h3><ul class="nlam__ul"><li><a href="https://nad-lan.co.il/projects/hamedina-en/"><bdi>Kikar HaMedina Towers</bdi></a>: <span class="nlam