>Shikun &amp; Binui</bdi></a>: <span class="nlam__num">324</span> apartments for long-term rent · a <span class="nlam__num">38</span>-floor tower and two <span class="nlam__num">8</span>-floor buildings</li><li><a href="https://nad-lan.co.il/projects/gindi-vogue-sde-dov-en/"><bdi>GINDI VOGUE</bdi></a>: A <span class="nlam__num">45</span>-floor tower and <span class="nlam__num">3</span> towers of <span class="nlam__num">20</span> floors · <span class="nlam__num">708</span> apartments</li><li><a href="https://nad-lan.co.il/projects/first-sde-dov/"><bdi>FIRST</bdi></a>: A <span class="nlam__num">45</span>-floor tower and <span class="nlam__num">3</span> boutique buildings of <span class="nlam__num">9</span> floors · <span class="nlam__num">350</span> apartments</li><li><a href="https://nad-lan.co.il/projects/migdalei-hayam-sde-dov/"><bdi>Mediterranean Towers</bdi></a>: Senior living · up to <span class="nlam__num">300</span> housing units</li></ul><h3 class="nlam__lh">Schools and kindergartens</h3><p class="nlam__lp"><b>Schools:</b> <bdi>Aran School</bdi>, <bdi>Kochav HaTzafon School</bdi>, <bdi>Nofei Yam School</bdi>, <bdi>Ironi Kaf Dalet Amos Oz</bdi></p><p class="nlam__lp"><b>Kindergartens:</b> <bdi>Abba Kovner 16</bdi>, <bdi>Yehuda Burla 2</bdi>, <bdi>Yehuda Amichai 1</bdi>, <bdi>Isaac Bashevis Singer 1</bdi>, <bdi>Isaac Bashevis Singer 7</bdi></p><h3 class="nlam__lh">Parks</h3><p class="nlam__lp"><b>Beaches:</b> <bdi>Northern Dog Beach</bdi>, <bdi>Tel Baruch Beach</bdi></p><p class="nlam__lp"><b>Promenades:</b> <bdi>Yarkon Estuary Promenade</bdi></p><p class="nlam__lp"><b>Parks:</b> <bdi>Kaf Gimel Yordei HaSira Memorial Garden</bdi>, <bdi>Jilber Garden</bdi>, <bdi>Kochav HaTzafon Garden</bdi>, <bdi>Lamed HaYeruka</bdi>, <bdi>Reading Beach Park</bdi></p><h3 class="nlam__lh">Shopping</h3><p class="nlam__lp"><b>Supermarkets:</b> <bdi>Shufersal Express</bdi> <span class="nlam__num">(2)</span></p><h3 class="nlam__lh">Transport</h3><p class="nlam__lp"><b>Future Green Li