ligne verte, les plages et les parcs, ainsi que les écoles et les jardins d’enfants alentour.</p></header><div class="nlam__chips" role="group" aria-label="Afficher sur la carte"><button type="button" class="nlam__chip" data-cat="projects" aria-pressed="true" disabled><span class="nlam__sw nlam__sw--pill" style="--c:var(--am-projects)"></span>Projets <span class="nlam__n">9</span></button><button type="button" class="nlam__chip" data-cat="edu" aria-pressed="true" disabled><span class="nlam__sw" style="--c:var(--am-edu)"></span>Écoles et jardins d’enfants <span class="nlam__n">9</span></button><button type="button" class="nlam__chip" data-cat="parks" aria-pressed="true" disabled><span class="nlam__sw" style="--c:var(--am-parks)"></span>Parcs <span class="nlam__n">8</span></button><button type="button" class="nlam__chip" data-cat="shop" aria-pressed="true" disabled><span class="nlam__sw" style="--c:var(--am-shop)"></span>Commerces <span class="nlam__n">2</span></button><button type="button" class="nlam__chip" data-cat="transit" aria-pressed="true" disabled><span class="nlam__sw" style="--c:var(--am-transit)"></span>Transports <span class="nlam__n">6</span></button></div><div class="nlam__frame"><div class="nlam__map" role="region" aria-label="Le quartier de Sde Dov sur la carte : les projets, la plage et les environs"></div><div class="nlam__wait" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M9 4.5 3.5 6.5v13l5.5-2 6 2 5.5-2v-13l-5.5 2-6-2z"/><path d="M9 4.5v13M15 6.5v13"/></svg><span>Chargement de la carte</span></div><button type="button" class="nlam__reset"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.65" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M3 12a9 9 0 1 0 3-6.7"/><path d="M3 4v5h5"/></svg>Revenir à la vue d’ensemble</button><div class="