<section class="nlds nlpg" id="nlpg" aria-labelledby="nlpg-t" dir="ltr" lang="en"><div class="nlpg__in"><header class="nlpg__head"><p class="nlds-kicker">Price guide · updated <span class="nlds-num">7 October 2026</span></p><h2 class="nlpg__title" id="nlpg-t">How much does an apartment cost at Kikar Hamedina Towers?</h2><p class="nlpg__answer">An apartment in Kikar Hamedina Towers sells for about ₪<span class="nlds-num">65,000</span> per m² on average, according to estimates published in October <span class="nlds-num">2026</span>. On floors <span class="nlds-num">38-39</span>, deals were recorded at ₪<span class="nlds-num">9.58</span> million to ₪<span class="nlds-num">10.63</span> million for a <span class="nlds-num">140</span> m² apartment with <span class="nlds-num">4</span> rooms, about ₪<span class="nlds-num">68,000</span> to ₪<span class="nlds-num">76,000</span> per m². In the neighbourhood around the square, the median deal in the first quarter of <span class="nlds-num">2026</span> was ₪<span class="nlds-num">4.94</span> million for <span class="nlds-num">3</span> rooms, ₪<span class="nlds-num">6.84</span> million for <span class="nlds-num">4</span> rooms and ₪<span class="nlds-num">8.46</span> million for <span class="nlds-num">5</span> rooms. In the new buildings around the square, prices have fallen from a peak of ₪<span class="nlds-num">70,000-75,000</span> per m² to ₪<span class="nlds-num">63,000-68,000</span>.</p></header><ul class="nlpg__tiles"><li><b>About ₪<span class="nlds-num">65,000</span></b><span>per m², the towers’ average deal, according to estimates</span><i><span class="nlds-num">10.2026</span></i></li><li><b>₪<span class="nlds-num">9.58-10.63</span> million</b><span><span class="nlds-num">3</span> deals, <span class="nlds-num">4</span> rooms, <span class="nlds-num">140</span> m², floors <span class="nlds-num">38-39</span></span><i><span class="nlds-num">4-12.2024</span></i></li><li><b>₪<span class="nlds-num">63,000-68,000</span></b><span>per m² in the new buildings around the square</span><i><span class="nlds-num">10.2026</span></i></li></ul><div class="nlpg__grid"><div class="nlpg__list"><table class="nlpg__table"><caption class="nlpg__cap">The price guide</caption><thead><tr><th scope="col">Property</th><th scope="col">₪ per m²</th><th scope="col">Apartment price, ₪</th><th scope="col">Type</th><th scope="col">Date</th></tr></thead><tbody class="nlpg__grp"><tr class="nlpg__gh"><th colspan="5" scope="colgroup">In Kikar Hamedina Towers</th></tr><tr><th scope="row"><b>Average deal in the towers</b><span>About <span class="nlds-num">10</span> to <span class="nlds-num">20</span> apartments or rights sold to date, according to estimates</span></th><td data-l="₪ per m²">about <span class="nlds-num">65,000</span></td><td data-l="Price"><span class="nlpg__na" aria-label="Not published">·</span></td><td data-l="Type"><span class="nlpg__k nlpg__k--est">Estimate</span></td><td data-l="Date"><span class="nlds-num">10.2026</span></td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><b><span class="nlds-num">4</span> rooms, <span class="nlds-num">140</span> m², floors <span class="nlds-num">38-39</span></b><span>Three deals</span></th><td data-l="₪ per m²"><span class="nlds-num">68,400-75,900</span></td><td data-l="Price"><span class="nlds-num">9.58-10.63</span> million</td><td data-l="Type"><span class="nlpg__k nlpg__k--deal">Deal</span></td><td data-l="Date"><span class="nlds-num">4-12.2024</span></td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><b>Higher-priced deals in the towers</b><span>In some of the deals</span></th><td data-l="₪ per m²">over <span class="nlds-num">80,000</span></td><td data-l="Price"><span class="nlpg__na" aria-label="Not published">·</span></td><td data-l="Type"><span class="nlpg__k nlpg__k--deal">Deal</span></td><td data-l="Date"><span class="nlds-num">10.2026</span></td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><b>Rights to a <span class="nlds-num">148</span> m² apartment, low floor</b><span>Listing</span></th><td data-l="₪ per m²">about <span class="nlds-num">42,600</span></td><td data-l="Price">about <span class="nlds-num">6.3</span> million</td><td data-l="Type"><span class="nlpg__k nlpg__k--ask">Asking price</span></td><td data-l="Date"><span class="nlds-num">4.2025</span></td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><b>Apartment on floor <span class="nlds-num">12</span></b><span>Listing</span></th><td data-l="₪ per m²"><span class="nlpg__na" aria-label="Not published">·</span></td><td data-l="Price"><span class="nlds-num">10.3</span> million</td><td data-l="Type"><span class="nlpg__k nlpg__k--ask">Asking price</span></td><td data-l="Date"><span class="nlds-num">4.2025</span></td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><b>Penthouse on floor <span class="nlds-num">39</span></b><span>Listing</span></th><td data-l="₪ per m²"><span class="nlpg__na" aria-label="Not published">·</span></td><td data-l="Price"><span class="nlds-num">43</span> million</td><td data-l="Type"><span class="nlpg__k nlpg__k--ask">Asking price</span></td><td data-l="Date"><span class="nlds-num">4.2025</span></td></tr></tbody><tbody class="nlpg__grp nlpg__grp--more"><tr class="nlpg__gh"><th colspan="5" scope="colgroup">Median deals in the neighbourhood, first quarter of 2026</th></tr><tr><th scope="row"><b><span class="nlds-num">3</span> rooms</b><span>All of Tel Aviv-Yafo: <span class="nlds-num">4.23</span> million</span></th><td data-l="₪ per m²"><span class="nlpg__na" aria-label="Not published">·</span></td><td data-l="Price"><span class="nlds-num">4.94</span> million</td><td data-l="Type"><span class="nlpg__k nlpg__k--med">Median deal</span></td><td data-l="Date"><span class="nlds-num">1-3.2026</span></td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><b><span class="nlds-num">4</span> rooms</b><span>All of Tel Aviv-Yafo: <span class="nlds-num">5.23</span> million</span></th><td data-l="₪ per m²"><span class="nlpg__na" aria-label="Not published">·</span></td><td data-l="Price"><span class="nlds-num">6.84</span> million</td><td data-l="Type"><span class="nlpg__k nlpg__k--med">Median deal</span></td><td data-l="Date"><span class="nlds-num">1-3.2026</span></td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><b><span class="nlds-num">5</span> rooms</b><span>All of Tel Aviv-Yafo: <span class="nlds-num">7.50</span> million</span></th><td data-l="₪ per m²"><span class="nlpg__na" aria-label="Not published">·</span></td><td data-l="Price"><span class="nlds-num">8.46</span> million</td><td data-l="Type"><span class="nlpg__k nlpg__k--med">Median deal</span></td><td data-l="Date"><span class="nlds-num">1-3.2026</span></td></tr></tbody><tbody class="nlpg__grp nlpg__grp--more"><tr class="nlpg__gh"><th colspan="5" scope="colgroup">Around the square, District 4</th></tr><tr><th scope="row"><b>New buildings, recently marketed projects</b><span>At the peak: ₪<span class="nlds-num">70,000-75,000</span> per m²</span></th><td data-l="₪ per m²"><span class="nlds-num">63,000-68,000</span></td><td data-l="Price"><span class="nlpg__na" aria-label="Not published">·</span></td><td data-l="Type"><span class="nlpg__k nlpg__k--mkt">Marketed price</span></td><td data-l="Date"><span class="nlds-num">10.2026</span></td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><b>Penthouses and garden apartments</b><span>Large apartments with outdoor space</span></th><td data-l="₪ per m²"><span class="nlds-num">80,000-110,000</span></td><td data-l="Price"><span class="nlpg__na" aria-label="Not published">·</span></td><td data-l="Type"><span class="nlpg__k nlpg__k--deal">Deal</span></td><td data-l="Date"><span class="nlds-num">10.2026</span></td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><b><span class="nlds-num">3-4</span> rooms in existing buildings</b><span>Four deals, <span class="nlds-num">70-110</span> m²</span></th><td data-l="₪ per m²"><span class="nlds-num">59,000-76,000</span></td><td data-l="Price"><span class="nlds-num">4.75-8.4</span> million</td><td data-l="Type"><span class="nlpg__k nlpg__k--deal">Deal</span></td><td data-l="Date"><span class="nlds-num">2026</span></td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><b>New apartments for sale on the square’s ring</b><span><span class="nlds-num">142-161</span> m², floors <span class="nlds-num">12</span> and <span class="nlds-num">23</span></span></th><td data-l="₪ per m²"><span class="nlds-num">79,000-90,000</span></td><td data-l="Price"><span class="nlds-num">11.25-14.5</span> million</td><td data-l="Type"><span class="nlpg__k nlpg__k--ask">Asking price</span></td><td data-l="Date"><span class="nlds-num">10.2026</span></td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><b>Apartment in an older building on the ring</b><span><span class="nlds-num">107</span> m², probably needs renovation</span></th><td data-l="₪ per m²">about <span class="nlds-num">43,000</span></td><td data-l="Price"><span class="nlds-num">4.59</span> million</td><td data-l="Type"><span class="nlpg__k nlpg__k--ask">Asking price</span></td><td data-l="Date"><span class="nlds-num">10.2026</span></td></tr></tbody><tbody class="nlpg__grp nlpg__grp--more"><tr class="nlpg__gh"><th colspan="5" scope="colgroup">For comparison</th></tr><tr><th scope="row"><b>Tel Aviv-Yafo, the whole city</b><span>Median of <span class="nlds-num">2,432</span> deals</span></th><td data-l="₪ per m²"><span class="nlds-num">52,856</span></td><td data-l="Price"><span class="nlpg__na" aria-label="Not published">·</span></td><td data-l="Type"><span class="nlpg__k nlpg__k--deal">Deal</span></td><td data-l="Date"><span class="nlds-num">10.2023-10.2025</span></td></tr></tbody></table><button class="nlpg__more" type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span class="nlpg__mt">The full price guide: around the square and for comparison <span class="nlds-num">(9)</span></span><span class="nlpg__mp">The full price guide <span class="nlds-num">(15)</span></span></button></div><form class="nlpg__calc" data-cfg="{&quot;modes&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;tower&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;In the towers&quot;,&quot;floor&quot;:true,&quot;lo_floor1&quot;:58000,&quot;hi_floor39&quot;:72000,&quot;band&quot;:0.07,&quot;why&quot;:&quot;An estimate by floor: from about ₪58,000 per m² on the low floors to about ₪72,000 on floors 38-39, around the average of about ₪65,000. Published deals on floors 38-39: ₪68,400-75,900 per m².&quot;},{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;new&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;New building nearby&quot;,&quot;lo&quot;:63000,&quot;hi&quot;:68000,&quot;why&quot;:&quot;Prices in new projects around the square that were marketed recently.&quot;},{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;resale&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;Existing apartment nearby&quot;,&quot;lo&quot;:59000,&quot;hi&quot;:76000,&quot;why&quot;:&quot;2026 deals for 3-4 room apartments in existing buildings around the square.&quot;},{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;premium&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;Penthouse or garden apartment&quot;,&quot;lo&quot;:80000,&quot;hi&quot;:110000,&quot;why&quot;:&quot;Large apartments, penthouses and garden apartments with outdoor space around the square.&quot;}],&quot;deals&quot;:[[38,68400],[39,68500],[38,75900]],&quot;avg&quot;:65000,&quot;ta&quot;:52856,&quot;tax1&quot;:[[1978745,0],[2347040,0.035],[6055070,0.05],[20183565,0.08],[null,0.1]],&quot;tax2&quot;:[[6055070,0.08],[null,0.1]],&quot;wa&quot;:&quot;{{WA}}&quot;,&quot;loc&quot;:&quot;en-GB&quot;,&quot;dec&quot;:&quot;.&quot;,&quot;t&quot;:{&quot;avg&quot;:&quot;Average deal, about {n}&quot;,&quot;deals&quot;:&quot;Published deals&quot;,&quot;f1&quot;:&quot;Floor 1&quot;,&quot;f40&quot;:&quot;Floor 40&quot;,&quot;axis&quot;:&quot;₪ per m² by floor&quot;,&quot;you&quot;:&quot;Your choice&quot;,&quot;tw&quot;:&quot;Towers’ average&quot;,&quot;ta&quot;:&quot;Tel Aviv-Yafo, median&quot;,&quot;aria_t&quot;:&quot;Estimate of ₪{lo} to ₪{hi} per m² on floor {f}, against the towers’ average deal of about ₪{avg}&quot;,&quot;aria_a&quot;:&quot;{m}: ₪{lo} to ₪{hi} per m², against the towers’ average of about ₪{avg} and Tel Aviv-Yafo at ₪{ta}&quot;,&quot;wa&quot;:&quot;Hello, I checked the Kikar Hamedina Towers price guide: {m}, {a} m²{f}, estimate ₪{r} million. I would like more details (nad-lan.co.il)&quot;,&quot;wa_f&quot;:&quot;, floor {f}&quot;,&quot;u_m2&quot;:&quot;{n} m²&quot;,&quot;u_floor&quot;:&quot;Floor {n}&quot;,&quot;u_mil&quot;:&quot;₪{n} million&quot;,&quot;u_ils&quot;:&quot;₪{n}&quot;,&quot;u_pm2&quot;:&quot;₪{n} per m²&quot;,&quot;approx&quot;:&quot;about {n}&quot;},&quot;floors&quot;:40}" novalidate><h3 class="nlpg__ct">Kikar Hamedina apartment price calculator</h3><fieldset class="nlpg__f"><legend>Where is the apartment</legend><div class="nlpg__seg"><label><input type="radio" name="nlpg-m" value="tower" checked><span>In the towers</span></label><label><input type="radio" name="nlpg-m" value="new"><span>New building nearby</span></label><label><input type="radio" name="nlpg-m" value="resale"><span>Existing apartment nearby</span></label><label><input type="radio" name="nlpg-m" value="premium"><span>Penthouse or garden apartment</span></label></div></fieldset><div class="nlpg__f"><label for="nlpg-a">Apartment area</label><div class="nlpg__rng"><input type="range" id="nlpg-a" data-pg="a" min="50" max="300" step="5" value="140"><output data-pg="ao" for="nlpg-a"><span class="nlds-num">140</span> m²</output></div></div><div class="nlpg__f" data-pg="fl"><label for="nlpg-fs">Floor</label><div class="nlpg__rng"><input type="range" id="nlpg-fs" data-pg="fs" min="1" max="40" step="1" value="20"><output data-pg="fo" for="nlpg-fs">Floor <span class="nlds-num">20</span></output></div></div><fieldset class="nlpg__f"><legend>Purchase tax</legend><div class="nlpg__seg nlpg__seg--2"><label><input type="radio" name="nlpg-t" value="single" checked><span>Single apartment</span></label><label><input type="radio" name="nlpg-t" value="more"><span>Additional apartment</span></label></div></fieldset><div class="nlpg__out" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true"><p class="nlpg__ol">Price estimate</p><p class="nlpg__big" data-pg="p">₪<span class="nlds-num">8.46-9.74</span> million</p><p class="nlpg__pm" data-pg="pm">about ₪<span class="nlds-num">60,400-69,600</span> per m²</p><svg class="nlpg__chart" data-pg="ch" viewBox="0 0 340 138" direction="ltr" role="img" focusable="false"><title>Price per m² by floor in the towers, with the published deals</title></svg><dl class="nlpg__rows"><div><dt>Purchase tax</dt><dd data-pg="tx">about ₪<span class="nlds-num">442,000</span></dd></div><div><dt>Total with tax</dt><dd data-pg="tt">about ₪<span class="nlds-num">9.54</span> million</dd></div></dl><p class="nlpg__why" data-pg="why">An estimate by floor: from about ₪<span class="nlds-num">58,000</span> per m² on the low floors to about ₪<span class="nlds-num">72,000</span> on floors <span class="nlds-num">38-39</span>, around the average of about ₪<span class="nlds-num">65,000</span>. Published deals on floors <span class="nlds-num">38-39</span>: ₪<span class="nlds-num">68,400-75,900</span> per m².</p></div><a class="nlds-btn nlds-btn--primary nlpg__wa" data-pg="wa" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-nlps-ev="pg-wa" href="https://wa.me/{{WA}}?text=">More details on WhatsApp</a><p class="nlpg__links"><a href="https://nad-lan.co.il/israel-purchase-tax-foreign-residents/">Israel purchase tax for foreign residents →</a><a href="https://nad-lan.co.il/israel-mortgage-non-residents/">Israeli mortgages for non-residents →</a></p><p class="nlpg__fine">A non-binding estimate, based on the deals and prices published up to <span class="nlds-num">7 October 2026</span>. In listings for expensive apartments, the asking price is usually <span class="nlds-num">5</span>%-<span class="nlds-num">10</span>% above the price actually agreed. The price is agreed with the seller.</p></form></div><p class="nlpg__src">This price guide draws on deals reported to the Tax Authority and published, on estimates by appraisers and property professionals in the area, and on listings for sale. Asking prices are marked separately and are not closing prices. Updated <span class="nlds-num">7</span> October <span class="nlds-num">2026</span>.</p></div></section>
