<section class="nlds nlpg" id="nlpg" aria-labelledby="nlpg-t" dir="ltr" lang="en"><div class="nlpg__in"><header class="nlpg__head"><p class="nlds-kicker">Price guide · updated <span class="nlds-num">7 October 2026</span></p><h2 class="nlpg__title" id="nlpg-t">How much does an apartment cost in Rova 4?</h2><p class="nlpg__answer">In the first quarter of <span class="nlds-num">2026</span>, the median deal for an apartment with <span class="nlds-num">4</span> rooms in Rova <span class="nlds-num">4</span> ranged from ₪<span class="nlds-num">6,042,800</span> to ₪<span class="nlds-num">6,910,000</span>, depending on the neighbourhood, against ₪<span class="nlds-num">5,229,800</span> across Tel Aviv-Yafo. For <span class="nlds-num">3</span> rooms, the median ranged from ₪<span class="nlds-num">4,434,900</span> to ₪<span class="nlds-num">4,943,500</span>. In the new buildings around Kikar HaMedina, prices stand at ₪<span class="nlds-num">63,000</span> to ₪<span class="nlds-num">68,000</span> per m², down from ₪<span class="nlds-num">70,000</span> to ₪<span class="nlds-num">75,000</span> at the peak, and penthouses and garden apartments reach ₪<span class="nlds-num">80,000</span> to ₪<span class="nlds-num">110,000</span> per m².</p></header><ul class="nlpg__tiles"><li><b>₪<span class="nlds-num">6.04-6.91</span> million</b><span>median deal, <span class="nlds-num">4</span> rooms, the three New North neighbourhoods. All of Tel Aviv-Yafo: <span class="nlds-num">5.23</span> million</span><i><span class="nlds-num">1-3.2026</span></i></li><li><b>₪<span class="nlds-num">63,000-68,000</span></b><span>per m² in new buildings around the square; <span class="nlds-num">70,000-75,000</span> at the peak</span><i><span class="nlds-num">10.2026</span></i></li><li><b>₪<span class="nlds-num">80,000-110,000</span></b><span>per m² for penthouses, garden apartments and large apartments</span><i><span class="nlds-num">10.2026</span></i></li></ul><div class="nlpg__grid"><div class="nlpg__list"><ta