></span></button><p class="nlpg__see"><a href="https://nad-lan.co.il/projects/hamedina-en/#nlpg">The Kikar HaMedina Towers price guide →</a></p></div><form class="nlpg__calc" data-cfg="{&quot;modes&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;new&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;New apartment in a new building&quot;,&quot;floor&quot;:false,&quot;lo&quot;:63000,&quot;hi&quot;:68000,&quot;why&quot;:&quot;Prices in new projects around Kikar HaMedina that were marketed recently. At the peak they stood at ₪70,000-75,000 per m². Most apartments sold in the new projects over the past year closed at ₪63,000-66,000 per m².&quot;},{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;resale&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;Existing apartment&quot;,&quot;floor&quot;:false,&quot;lo&quot;:59000,&quot;hi&quot;:70000,&quot;why&quot;:&quot;The range of deals published in 2026 for apartments with 2 to 4 rooms in the district, without penthouses, garden apartments or new-build projects. An asking price in an older building was also as low as ₪42,900 per m², but that is a listing, not a deal.&quot;},{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;premium&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;Penthouse or garden apartment&quot;,&quot;floor&quot;:false,&quot;lo&quot;:80000,&quot;hi&quot;:110000,&quot;why&quot;:&quot;Large apartments, penthouses and garden apartments with large outdoor space in the district. The price per m² is calculated on the built area.&quot;}],&quot;deals&quot;:[],&quot;avg&quot;:65000,&quot;ta&quot;:52856,&quot;tax1&quot;:[[1978745,0],[2347040,0.035],[6055070,0.05],[20183565,0.08],[null,0.1]],&quot;tax2&quot;:[[6055070,0.08],[null,0.1]],&quot;wa&quot;:&quot;{{WA}}&quot;,&quot;loc&quot;:&quot;en-GB&quot;,&quot;dec&quot;:&quot;.&quot;,&quot;t&quot;:{&quot;avg&quot;:&quot;Average deal, about {n}&quot;,&quot;deals&quot;:&quot;Published deals&quot;,&quot;f1&quot;:&quot;Floor 1&quot;,&quot;f40&quot;:&quot;Floor 40&quot;,&quot;axis&quot;:&quot;₪ per m² by floor&quot;,&quot;you&quot;:&quot;Your choice&quot;,&quot;tw&quot;:&quot;Kikar HaMedina average&quot;,&quot;ta&quot;:&quot;Tel Aviv-Yafo, median&quot;,&quot;aria_t&quot;:&quot;Estimate of ₪{lo} to ₪{hi} per m² on floor {f}, against the towers’ average deal of about ₪{avg}&quot;,&quot;aria_a&quot;:&quot;{m}: ₪{lo} to ₪{hi} per m², against the towers’ average of about ₪{avg} and Tel Aviv-Yafo at ₪{ta}&quot;,&quot;wa&quot;:&quot;Hello, I checked the Rova 4 Tel Aviv price guide: {m}, {a} m², estimate ₪{r} million. I would like more details (nad-lan.co.il)&quot;,&quot;wa_f&quot;:&quot;, floor {f}&quot;,&quot;u_m2&quot;:&quot;{n} m²&quot;,&quot;u_floor&quot;:&quot;Floor {n}&quot;,&quot;u_mil&quot;:&quot;₪{n} million&quot;,&quot;u_ils&quot;:&quot;₪{n}&quot;,&quot;u_pm2&quot;:&quot;₪{n} per m²&quot;,&quot;approx&quot;:&quot;about {n}&quot;},&quot;floors&quot;:40}" novalidate><h3 class="nlpg__ct">Rova 4 apartment price calculator</h3><fieldset class="nlpg__f"><legend>Where is the apartment</legend><div class="nlpg__seg"><label><input type="radio" name="nlpg-m" value="new" checked><span>New apartment in a new building</span></label><label><input type="radio" name="nlpg-m" value="resale"><span>Existing apartment</span></label><label><input type="radio" name="nlpg-m" value="premium"><span>Penthouse or garden apartment</span></label></div></fieldset><div class="nlpg__f"><label for="nlpg-a">Apartment area</label><div class="nlpg__rng"><input type="range" id="nlpg-a" data-pg="a" min="50" max="300" step="5" value="100"><output data-pg="ao" for="nlpg-a"><span class="nlds-num">100</span> m²</output></div></div><div class="nlpg__f" data-pg="fl" hidden><label for="nlpg-fs">Floor</label><div class="nlpg__rng"><input type="range" id="nlpg-fs" data-pg="fs" min="1" max="40" step="1" value="20"><output data-pg="fo" for="nlpg-fs">Floor <span class="nlds-num">20</span></output></div></div><fieldset class="nlpg__f"><legend>Purchase tax</legend><div class="nlpg__seg nlpg__seg--2"><label><input type="radio" name="nlpg-t" value="single" checked><span>Single apartment</span></label><label><input type="radio" name="nlpg-t" value="more"><span>Additional apartment</span></label></div></fieldset><div class="nlpg__out" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true"><p class="nlpg__ol">Price estimate</p><p class="nlpg__big" data-pg="p">₪<span class="nlds-num">6.3-6.8</span> million</p><p class="nlpg__pm" data-pg="pm">about ₪<span class="nlds-num">63,000-68,000</span> per m²</p><svg class="nlpg__chart" data-pg="ch" viewBox="0 0 340 138" direction="ltr" role="img" focusable="false"><title>Price per m² for your choice, against the Kikar HaMedina Towers average and Tel Aviv-Yafo</title></svg><dl class="nlpg__rows"><div><dt>Purchase tax</dt><dd data-pg="tx">about ₪<span class="nlds-num">238,000</span></dd></div><div><dt>Total with tax</dt><dd data-pg="tt">about ₪<span class="nlds-num">6.79</span> million</dd></div></dl><p class="nlpg__why" data-pg="why">Prices in new projects around Kikar HaMedina that were marketed recently. At the peak they stood at ₪<span class="nlds-num">70,000-75,000</span> per m². Most apartments sold in the new projects over the past year closed at ₪<span class="nlds-num">63,000-66,000</span> per m².</p></div><a class="nlds-btn nlds-btn--primary nlpg__wa" data-pg="wa" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-nlps-ev="pg-wa" href="https://wa.me/{{WA}}?text=">More details on WhatsApp</a><p class="nlpg__links"><a href="https://nad-lan.co.il/israel-purchase-tax-foreign-residents/">Israel purchase tax for foreign residents →</a><a href="https://nad-lan.co.il/israel-mortgage-non-residents/">Israeli mortgages for non-residents →</a></p><p class="nlpg__fine">A non-binding estimate, based on the deals and prices published up to <span class="nlds-num">7 October 2026</span>. In listings for expensive apartments, the asking price is usually <span class="nlds-num">5</span>%-<span class="nlds-num">10</span>% above the price actually agreed. The price is agreed with the seller.</p></form></div><p class="nlpg__src">This price guide draws on median deals reported to the Tax Authority, on published deals, on estimates by property professionals in the area and on listings for sale. Asking prices are marked separately and are not closing prices. Updated <span class="nlds-num">7</span> October <span class="nlds-num">2026</span>.</p></div></section>
