<section class="nlds nlpg nlpg--fold" id="nlpg" aria-labelledby="nlpg-t" dir="ltr" lang="en"><div class="nlpg__in"><header class="nlpg__head"><p class="nlds-kicker">Price guide · updated <span class="nlds-num">7 October 2026</span></p><h2 class="nlpg__title" id="nlpg-t">Sde Dov apartment prices, project by project</h2><p class="nlpg__answer">According to a review of the developers’ reports published in April <span class="nlds-num">2026</span>, the roughly <span class="nlds-num">1,280</span> apartments sold by then in the Sde Dov quarter averaged about ₪<span class="nlds-num">83,000</span> per m², and a <span class="nlds-num">4</span>-room apartment sold for about ₪<span class="nlds-num">9.45</span> million on average. The gap between projects is wide: in the <span class="nlds-num">2025</span> reports, from about ₪<span class="nlds-num">63,400</span> per m² at ZOHI Tel Aviv to about ₪<span class="nlds-num">82,600</span> at DIMRI YAMA, including VAT. In <span class="nlds-num">2026</span> most projects in the quarter are selling at about ₪<span class="nlds-num">70,000</span> per m², and deals at ₪<span class="nlds-num">54,000-57,000</span> per m² were also recorded in March <span class="nlds-num">2026</span>.</p></header><ul class="nlpg__tiles"><li><b>About ₪<span class="nlds-num">83,000</span></b><span>per m², the average of the roughly <span class="nlds-num">1,280</span> apartments sold in the quarter, according to the developers’ reports</span><i><span class="nlds-num">4.2026</span></i></li><li><b>₪<span class="nlds-num">63,400-82,600</span></b><span>per m², the average sale prices of four projects in <span class="nlds-num">2025</span>, including VAT</span><i><span class="nlds-num">2025</span></i></li><li><b>About ₪<span class="nlds-num">70,000</span></b><span>per m² in most projects in the quarter in <span class="nlds-num">2026</span></span><i><span class="nlds-num">5-6.2026</span></i></li></ul><div class="nlpg__grid"><div class="nlpg__list"><table class="nlpg__tab