de-dov-en/#nlpjx-price">DIMRI YAMA Sde Dov: prices and comparison →</a></p><p class="nlpg__see"><a href="https://nad-lan.co.il/projects/ashira-sde-dov-en/#nlpjx-price">ASHIRA Sde Dov: prices and comparison →</a></p><p class="nlpg__see"><a href="https://nad-lan.co.il/en/north-tel-aviv/rova-4/#nlpg">The Rova 4 price guide, near Kikar HaMedina →</a></p></div><form class="nlpg__calc" data-cfg="{&quot;modes&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;area&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;Most projects in the quarter&quot;,&quot;floor&quot;:false,&quot;lo&quot;:70000,&quot;hi&quot;:83000,&quot;why&quot;:&quot;In 2026 most projects in the quarter are selling at about ₪70,000 per m². The average of all the apartments sold in the quarter up to April 2026 was about ₪83,000 per m², and the official price in the projects, before financing benefits, is ₪75,000-85,000.&quot;},{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;entry&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;A project with a low entry price&quot;,&quot;floor&quot;:false,&quot;lo&quot;:54000,&quot;hi&quot;:64000,&quot;why&quot;:&quot;The lowest-priced deals published in the quarter in 2026: two 5-room apartments at ₪54,000-57,000 per m², and most recent deals in one of the projects in the Eshkol compound at ₪60,000-62,000. In the project that opened at ₪49,000 per m², the average has already passed ₪60,000.&quot;},{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;sea&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;High floor or facing the sea&quot;,&quot;floor&quot;:false,&quot;lo&quot;:90000,&quot;hi&quot;:110000,&quot;why&quot;:&quot;According to one of the quarter’s developers, selected apartments sold at ₪90,000-100,000 per m². In the three largest deals, on floors 38-43 of one of the towers in December 2025, the price was about ₪107,700 to about ₪119,200 per m² of built area, without the balconies.&quot;},{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;rainbow&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;Rainbow&quot;,&quot;floor&quot;:false,&quot;lo&quot;:80500,&quot;hi&quot;:85700,&quot;why&quot;:&quot;The average of all the apartments sold in the project up to March 2026 was about ₪81,800 per m². In the first quarter of 2026 the average reached up to about ₪85,700, and in the second quarter it was about ₪80,500.&quot;},{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;dimri&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;DIMRI YAMA&quot;,&quot;floor&quot;:false,&quot;lo&quot;:73200,&quot;hi&quot;:82500,&quot;why&quot;:&quot;Between the developer’s valuation of the unsold apartments, about ₪73,200 per m², and the average deal of 2025, about ₪82,500, including VAT. In early 2026 the average was about ₪75,500.&quot;},{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;ashira&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;ASHIRA&quot;,&quot;floor&quot;:false,&quot;lo&quot;:64500,&quot;hi&quot;:72000,&quot;why&quot;:&quot;Between the average of the 31 apartments sold in 2025, about ₪64,500 per m², and the average of the second quarter of 2026, about ₪72,000. It was not published whether the averages include VAT.&quot;}],&quot;deals&quot;:[],&quot;avg&quot;:83000,&quot;ta&quot;:52856,&quot;tax1&quot;:[[1978745,0],[2347040,0.035],[6055070,0.05],[20183565,0.08],[null,0.1]],&quot;tax2&quot;:[[6055070,0.08],[null,0.1]],&quot;wa&quot;:&quot;{{WA}}&quot;,&quot;loc&quot;:&quot;en-GB&quot;,&quot;dec&quot;:&quot;.&quot;,&quot;t&quot;:{&quot;avg&quot;:&quot;Quarter average, about {n}&quot;,&quot;deals&quot;:&quot;Published deals&quot;,&quot;f1&quot;:&quot;Floor 1&quot;,&quot;f40&quot;:&quot;Floor 40&quot;,&quot;axis&quot;:&quot;₪ per m² by floor&quot;,&quot;you&quot;:&quot;Your choice&quot;,&quot;tw&quot;:&quot;Sde Dov average&quot;,&quot;ta&quot;:&quot;Tel Aviv-Yafo, median&quot;,&quot;aria_t&quot;:&quot;Estimate of ₪{lo} to ₪{hi} per m² on floor {f}, against the towers’ average deal of about ₪{avg}&quot;,&quot;aria_a&quot;:&quot;{m}: ₪{lo} to ₪{hi} per m², against the quarter’s average of about ₪{avg} and Tel Aviv-Yafo at ₪{ta}&quot;,&quot;wa&quot;:&quot;Hello, I checked the Sde Dov price guide: {m}, {a} m², estimate ₪{r} million. I would like more details (nad-lan.co.il)&quot;,&quot;wa_f&quot;:&quot;, floor {f}&quot;,&quot;u_m2&quot;:&quot;{n} m²&quot;,&quot;u_floor&quot;:&quot;Floor {n}&quot;,&quot;u_mil&quot;:&quot;₪{n} million&quot;,&quot;u_ils&quot;:&quot;₪{n}&quot;,&quot;u_pm2&quot;:&quot;₪{n} per m²&quot;,&quot;approx&quot;:&quot;about {n}&quot;},&quot;floors&quot;:40}" novalidate><h3 class="nlpg__ct">Sde Dov apartment price calculator</h3><fieldset class="nlpg__f"><legend>Where is the apartment</legend><div class="nlpg__seg"><label><input type="radio" name="nlpg-m" value="area" checked><span>Most projects in the quarter</span></label><label><input type="radio" name="nlpg-m" value="entry"><span>A project with a low entry price</span></label><label><input type="radio" name="nlpg-m" value="sea"><span>High floor or facing the sea</span></label><label><input type="radio" name="nlpg-m" value="rainbow"><span>Rainbow</span></label><label><input type="radio" name="nlpg-m" value="dimri"><span>DIMRI YAMA</span></label><label><input type="radio" name="nlpg-m" value="ashira"><span>ASHIRA</span></label></div></fieldset><div class="nlpg__f"><label for="nlpg-a">Apartment area</label><div class="nlpg__rng"><input type="range" id="nlpg-a" data-pg="a" min="50" max="300" step="5" value="100"><output data-pg="ao" for="nlpg-a"><span class="nlds-num">100</span> m²</output></div></div><div class="nlpg__f" data-pg="fl" hidden><label for="nlpg-fs">Floor</label><div class="nlpg__rng"><input type="range" id="nlpg-fs" data-pg="fs" min="1" max="40" step="1" value="20"><output data-pg="fo" for="nlpg-fs">Floor <span class="nlds-num">20</span></output></div></div><fieldset class="nlpg__f"><legend>Purchase tax</legend><div class="nlpg__seg nlpg__seg--2"><label><input type="radio" name="nlpg-t" value="single" checked><span>Single apartment</span></label><label><input type="radio" name="nlpg-t" value="more"><span>Additional apartment</span></label></div></fieldset><div class="nlpg__out" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true"><p class="nlpg__ol">Price estimate</p><p class="nlpg__big" data-pg="p">₪<span class="nlds-num">7-8.3</span> million</p><p class="nlpg__pm" data-pg="pm">about ₪<span class="nlds-num">70,000-83,000</span> per m²</p><svg class="nlpg__chart" data-pg="ch" viewBox="0 0 340 138" direction="ltr" role="img" focusable="false"><title>Price per m² for your choice, against the Sde Dov average and Tel Aviv-Yafo</title></svg><dl class="nlpg__rows"><div><dt>Purchase tax</dt><dd data-pg="tx">about ₪<span class="nlds-num">326,000</span></dd></div><div><dt>Total with tax</dt><dd data-pg="tt">about ₪<span class="nlds-num">7.98</span> million</dd></div></dl><p class="nlpg__why" data-pg="why">In <span class="nlds-num">2026</span> most projects in the quarter are selling at about ₪<span class="nlds-num">70,000</span> per m². The average of all the apartments sold in the quarter up to April <span class="nlds-num">2026</span> was about ₪<span class="nlds-num">83,000</span> per m², and the official price in the projects, before financing benefits, is ₪<span class="nlds-num">75,000-85,000</span>.</p></div><a class="nlds-btn nlds-btn--primary nlpg__wa" data-pg="wa" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-nlps-ev="pg-wa" href="https://wa.me/{{WA}}?text=">More details on WhatsApp</a><p class="nlpg__links"><a href="https://nad-lan.co.il/israel-purchase-tax-foreign-residents/">Israel purchase tax for foreign residents →</a><a href="https://nad-lan.co.il/israel-mortgage-non-residents/">Israeli mortgages for non-residents →</a></p><p class="nlpg__fine">A non-binding estimate, based on the deals and prices published up to <span class="nlds-num">7 October 2026</span>. In the Sde Dov quarter, the financing benefits in some projects amount to a <span class="nlds-num">6-8</span>% discount on the list price. Most of the developers’ averages include VAT; for ASHIRA it was not published whether they do. The price is agreed with the seller.</p></form></div><p class="nlpg__src">This price guide draws on the developers’ reports as published, on deals reported to the Tax Authority and published, on the official median deal price by neighbourhood and on marketing prices published in the quarter. Marketed prices and estimates are marked separately and are not closing prices. Updated <span class="nlds-num">7</span> October <span class="nlds-num">2026</span>.</p></div></section>
